      "type": "concept",
      "label": "Star Key Selected Presentation",
      "domain": "shared",
      "layer": "knowledge",
      "desc": "September 7 design for an inspectable selection of VTA identity, relationships, knowledge pathways, agreements and artefacts. A presentation must bind its audience, purpose and verified claims; geometry and compression do not confer authority.",
